  "why_this_file_exists": "FIFTH CONSECUTIVE PACK REGRESSION, to the same parent — AND THE FIRST TIME A HUMAN NOTE HAS CLAIMED OTHERWISE. docs/human/HUMAN_DATA_NOTE_SLICE67.md states 'Pack base: post-restore slice66 tree (not slice-61)'. It is false: three whole-file digests read slice-61's values and EDGE.md contains zero of sections 45 through 49. Recorded without accusation. Across slices 62-66 every note claim about DATA verified; this is the first claim about PROCESS and the first to fail — a human can check a bar count by looking at the file they wrote, but cannot check which parent their build script used. EDGE.md §50a.",
