        "why": "The broadcast guard FIRED ON A REPAIR. Slice 65 wrote it to assert that all three symbols declare the same count, and said in its docstring that if that stopped being true the broadcast may have been repaired. It stopped: BTC advanced to 1466/4399 and ETH and SOL did not follow, for the first time in four slices. EDGE.md §50b.",
